+	 * TiVo write-credit I/O throttle (72 bytes, device offsets 820..891).
+	 * Known: [0] requests_read 820, [5] write_credits 840, [6] credits used 844,
+	 * [7] writes_per_sec 848, [8] writes_per_sec_reading 852, [9] credit_writes 856,
+	 * [10] last refill jiffies 860, [11] credit_period 864.
